.nuke/temp/
**/bin/
**/obj/
.coverage/
**/TestResults/

# Generated at build time by MSBuild (API URL override / Mapbox public token)
BibleOnSite/Resources/Raw/api-config.txt
BibleOnSite/Resources/Raw/mapbox-token.txt

# Large generated asset (on-demand delivery) — run: cd data && cargo make generate-perushim-view-sqlite
# The .sqlite is gitignored (150 MB); the .sqlite.gz is tracked (~35 MB).
# Decompressed at dev-setup time and as an MSBuild safety net before builds.
# Perushim data updates are coupled to app releases (no independent data push).
# Android: decompressed into PAD asset pack folder.
BibleOnSite/Platforms/Android/AssetPacks/perushim_notes/*.sqlite
!BibleOnSite/Platforms/Android/AssetPacks/perushim_notes/*.sqlite.gz
# iOS: decompressed into the managed asset-pack folder next to Manifest.json.
BibleOnSite/Platforms/iOS/AssetPacks/perushim_notes/*.sqlite

# xcodebuild derived data for the managed asset-pack downloader extension.
extensions/AssetPackDownloader/build/

# The prebuilt search index rides in the same pack but its .gz (~121 MB) exceeds
# GitHub's 100 MB push limit — it travels via CI artifacts + app packages only.
BibleOnSite/Platforms/Android/AssetPacks/perushim_notes/*.hebrew_search.sqlite.gz
